  "question": {
    "text": "At $273 \\mathrm{~K}$ temperature and $76 \\mathrm{~cm~} \\mathrm{Hg}$ pressure, the density of a gas is $1.964 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~L}^{-1} .$ The gas is",
